{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to .mcp.json (gitignored). Claude Code started from the repo root (./rocky.sh chat) uses it as is:",
    "the command is the repo venv's python, relative to the repo root, and `-m harness.server` needs that cwd too.",
    "Clients that start elsewhere (Claude Desktop, other MCP hosts): make command the ABSOLUTE path to",
    ".venv/bin/python and add \"cwd\": \"/absolute/path/to/rocky\".",
    "ROCKY_BACKEND: auto = the running cockpit (./rocky.sh cockpit, 127.0.0.1:8765) if one answers, else the",
    "in-process MuJoCo sim | cockpit = the cockpit or refuse to start | sim = in-process MuJoCo | mock =",
    "millisecond-fast contract, no physics (the default when unset).",
    "With the in-process sim: ROCKY_WORLD flat|room|cliff; ROCKY_VIEWER=1 ROCKY_AUDIO=1 MUJOCO_GL=glfw add the",
    "live window and the speakers. With the cockpit these belong to the cockpit, not to this server."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "rocky": {
      "command": ".venv/bin/python",
      "args": ["-m", "harness.server"],
      "env": {"ROCKY_BACKEND": "auto", "ROCKY_WORLD": "flat"}
    }
  }
}
